OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fpleasantly warm end to Friday with
OL,7,Fplenty of evening sunshine. Dry
OL,8,Fovernight with long clear periods and
OL,9,Fturning rather fresh with rural spots
OL,10,Fpossibly getting quite chilly by the
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA mainly sunny start and
OL,14,Fsoon warming up. Fair weather cloud
OL,15,Fbubbling up, but lengthy sunny periods
OL,16,Fcontinuing throughout the afternoon.
OL,17,FSome wispy high cloud may build later.
OL,18,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
